,"sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2829","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2829","name":"癸乙夜","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:77028","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c34494","characterName":"澄美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"37225","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25564"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9456"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34494"},"originalCharacterName":"澄美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1024"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Minatohashi Higashi Academy. When her parents divorced when she was young, she went to live with her mother. She was told her father had died and doesn’t even really remember having an older brother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But one day, her mother suddenly passed away. With no one else to rely on, she creates an account on Free Friends to earn enough money to live on. Her first partner is Kaito, and the two begin their relationship without realizing that they’re brother and sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Raised by her mother, Sumire’s a responsible girl who can handle all household tasks even at her relatively young age. However, she can be rash and make decisions impulsively without giving them much thought, so sometimes she makes people around her end up worrying about her. She's also an optimistic hard worker, positive even in the face of setbacks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobby is reading shoujo manga. She has a lot of friends, and has lived a relatively carefree life. Despite having a pretty good figure, she’s completely sexually inexperienced."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34494"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に両親が離婚し母親に引き取られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父は死んだと聞かされており、幼少期の記憶(兄に関すること)は覚えていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二人で暮らしていた母が亡くなってしまった上に頼れる身内もなく、生活費を稼ぐ為にフリフレに登録し、初めての援助交際相手として海人と出会った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし海人こそ唯一残った肉親・実の兄であった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして互いにその事実に気づかないまま関係してしまう…"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9456","sourceWorkId":"16214","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教育実習生である主人公が、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出会い系の掲示板FreeFirends（フリフレ）でお互いの素性を知らないまま抱いた女性が、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生き別れの実の妹と知ってしまった事から始まる物語。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37225"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bc174394f04409a9a8bc8e0a0084eab463efaac4dabfe882849876c00e7d368.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/340e172425f35f28cf1e66d6c50741d2568663d3ef70d4ace31dc7e73ae5aa67.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"優稀澪","creatorId":"vndb:s831","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s831","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s831","name":"優稀 澪","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:25564:37225:14423:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c38480","characterName":"汐見 海人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c38480"},"originalCharacterName":"汐見 海人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{